// array_text_combined_region_add_const_one_from_classifier.hako - hand-authored combined-region add-const-one classifier
//
// Responsibility:
// - classify the combined-region add-const-one pattern
// - stay pure: scalar pattern tokens in, boolean text out
//
// Non-responsibility:
// - array-text combined region planning
// - backend lowering
